+#: Environment variable names per topic, most preferred first.
+#:
+#: ``PENNY_TOPIC_*`` is the primary naming: it reads more clearly and matches the
+#: topic titles in the group ("Early Radar", "Circuit Risk").  The
+#: ``PENNY_*_TOPIC_ID`` form is accepted as a fallback so either convention works
